# Dead-key compose table for XIM-based clients (st, xterm, ...).
#
# XCOMPOSEFILE is set to this file in modules/users.nix. libX11 does not
# fall back to its built-in table when XCOMPOSEFILE is set, so without an
# "include" all dead keys (dead_acute, dead_cedilla, dead_tilde, ...) stop
# composing. Pull in the system table and add custom sequences below if
# needed.
include "%L"
